2. **Temporal Quantization**: Transition phase deltas ($\Delta t_{\text{trans}}$) are quantized to discrete frame tick units:
   $$k = \text{round}\left( \frac{\Delta t_{\text{trans}}}{\tau_{\text{tick}}} \right), \quad \tau_{\text{tick}} \approx 15.625\text{ ms}$$
3. **Symbolic Classification**: The integer value $k \in [0, 15]$ maps to a discrete event code $c \in \{1, 2, 3\}$:
